    "body": "With DP attention, DFLASH requires `--enable-dp-lm-head`, which shards the target lm_head over the attention-TP group. `candidate_topk` still all-gathered the per-shard candidates over the full TP group, so each DP rank's candidates mixed in other DP ranks' rows.\n\nGather over the group the head is sharded on: `attn_tp_group` when `lm_head.use_attn_tp_group`, else `tp_group`.\n\nThe vocab-shard gather test now runs for both head layouts and fails if the candidates are gathered over the wrong group.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #40882718651](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40882718651)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #40882718256](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40882718256)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #40882718022](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40882718022)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
